          "part_3_html": "<div class=\"collection-seo-rich__links\" aria-label=\"Related dress collections\"><a class=\"collection-seo-rich__link\" href=\"{{ matching_outfits_url }}\">Bla gjennom Family Matching-huben</a><a class=\"collection-seo-rich__link\" href=\"{{ mommy_and_me_url }}\">Se alle mamma og meg-antrekkene</a></div>"
